# A definition's references into one unknown universe get one diagnostic, even when they name earlier definitions in the same file.
define the potential position<mv:define-lang.org:other_lib:/a>.
define the potential position<mv:define-lang.org:other_lib:/b>.
define the potential position<mv:define-lang.org:parent_universe:/test> {
    it may only contain particles where {
        it has the position<mv:define-lang.org:other_lib:/a>.
        it has the position<mv:define-lang.org:other_lib:/b>.
    }
}
